exercises.instructions:
Write a function called `findArtist` that takes an array of artist objects and a name string, and returns the artist object with that name. Return `undefined` if not found.

Example:
```
findArtist(artists, "Billie Eyelash")
// Returns: { id: 5, name: "Billie Eyelash", genres: ["alt-pop", ...], ... }
```

exercises.starterCode:
// Find and return the artist with the given name
function findArtist(artists, name) {

}

exercises.solution:
function findArtist(artists, name) {
  return artists.find(artist => artist.name === name);
}

